1
00:01:35,599 --> 00:01:37,359
What's wrong, Naonao, pouting like that?

2
00:01:37,879 --> 00:01:38,599
Are you upset?

3
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,920
Uncle Liao lied.

4
00:01:40,959 --> 00:01:42,040
When did I lie to you?

5
00:01:42,359 --> 00:01:43,840
Uncle Liao promised Naonao

6
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,599
to take Naonao out to play.

7
00:01:45,959 --> 00:01:47,480
I did promise

8
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:49,599
to have Auntie Chen play games with you.

9
00:01:50,239 --> 00:01:51,840
Auntie Chen didn't play games.

10
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,840
She asked me a lot of questions.

11
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,799
Alright, I'll take you out to play now.

12
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,079
Okay.

13
00:01:58,159 --> 00:01:59,079
What do you want to play?

14
00:01:59,719 --> 00:02:02,560
I want the ball pit and excavators.

15
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:03,439
And...

16
00:02:03,439 --> 00:02:05,239
and I also want to catch goldfish.

17
00:02:05,239 --> 00:02:05,920
Alright, alright.

18
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,680
Don't give in to his every whim.

19
00:02:08,479 --> 00:02:10,080
He's a kid, right? He should play.

20
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:11,919
Why don't we go together?

21
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,759
You take him.

22
00:02:14,039 --> 00:02:15,240
Someone's delivering goods this afternoon.

23
00:02:15,599 --> 00:02:16,520
The shop can't be empty.

24
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:17,960
Okay.

25
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:22,039
We just finished the City Police Bureau meeting.

26
00:02:22,639 --> 00:02:24,120
Let me brief you on it.

27
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:26,199
This operation is huge.

28
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:29,680
Criminal Investigation, Narcotics, and SWAT are mobilizing.

29
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,439
Don't you think you should come back?

30
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:32,599
Captain Liu is there.

31
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,680
He's seen it all.

32
00:02:33,879 --> 00:02:34,919
Just follow his command.

33
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,439
Come back quickly.

34
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:43,479
Wasn't I on secondment to the traffic police?

35
00:02:44,039 --> 00:02:46,159
I haven't been on a mission for so long.

36
00:02:46,599 --> 00:02:47,960
I'm afraid I'll be a bit rusty.

37
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:48,680
Come back quickly.

38
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:51,360
Come on, Brother Lang, you're a SWAT veteran.

39
00:02:54,479 --> 00:02:55,080
Chief Liao.

40
00:02:56,039 --> 00:02:57,840
I trust Captain Liu's abilities.

41
00:02:58,159 --> 00:03:00,080
But I must tell you the truth.

42
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:01,280
For this operation,

43
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:03,400
our Special Police Unit absolutely cannot

44
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:06,479
afford even the slightest mistake.

45
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:09,319
So I think you,

46
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,000
you must come back.

47
00:03:10,599 --> 00:03:11,360
Exactly.

48
00:03:11,879 --> 00:03:13,080
That's why Captain Liu is there.

49
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,120
As long as you listen to him, you won't go wrong.

50
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:22,879
I'm hanging up.

51
00:03:26,199 --> 00:03:26,479
Political Commissar.

52
00:03:30,159 --> 00:03:31,039
Do you really trust me?

53
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:33,199
Of course.

54
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:34,159
What's on your mind?

55
00:03:35,439 --> 00:03:35,759
Okay.

56
00:03:37,439 --> 00:03:38,360
I won't let you down.

57
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,439
This operation is quite extraordinary.

58
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:42,919
Its massive scale,

59
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:44,639
extreme danger,

60
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,599
multi-branch involvement,

61
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:50,159
and the superiors' attention are unprecedented.

62
00:03:50,639 --> 00:03:52,479
You've talked forever, what's the mission?

63
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,919
You didn't even explain it clearly.

64
00:03:54,479 --> 00:03:55,439
Don't snoop around things you shouldn't know.

65
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:56,319
Right, Jiani?

66
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,000
Lü Xiao.

67
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,759
What are you blabbering about here again?

68
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:04,039
I'm giving everyone a pre-operation briefing.

69
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,360
Why don't you host this meeting instead?

70
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:07,680
You do it. You do it.

71
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:14,840
Comrades.

72
00:04:15,719 --> 00:04:16,600
This mission

73
00:04:17,199 --> 00:04:18,079
is extraordinary.

74
00:04:18,759 --> 00:04:19,600
Its massive scale,

75
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:21,439
extreme danger,

76
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,360
multi-branch involvement,

77
00:04:23,639 --> 00:04:25,439
and superiors' attention

78
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,360
are unprecedented.

79
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:27,879
Still the same old rules.

80
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,319
Don't act rashly.

81
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:30,439
Don't show off.

82
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:31,480
Don't underestimate the enemy.

83
00:04:31,519 --> 00:04:32,480
Don't get nervous.

84
00:04:32,519 --> 00:04:34,519
Follow orders in all operations.

85
00:04:34,519 --> 00:04:34,959
Yes, sir.

86
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,199
Now, let's invite Political Commissar Tan

87
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,160
to give us the pre-operation briefing.

88
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:39,720
Round of applause!

89
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,240
I'll just say one thing.

90
00:04:46,759 --> 00:04:48,040
I hope all comrades

91
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:49,480
return home safely.

92
00:04:50,519 --> 00:04:51,240
Let me add one more thing.

93
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:52,759
Today,

94
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:54,319
dinner is at 17:00.

95
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:55,680
Report!

96
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:00,800
Political Commissar Tan.

97
00:05:01,839 --> 00:05:02,199
Captain Liu.

98
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,000
I request to join the operation.

99
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:16,120
Yunsheng.

100
00:05:17,399 --> 00:05:19,439
You're currently seconded to the police station.

101
00:05:20,279 --> 00:05:21,680
I'm afraid you can't join the operation.

102
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:22,519
I've already asked about that.

103
00:05:23,639 --> 00:05:25,040
If the Special Police Unit needs backup for an operation,

104
00:05:26,079 --> 00:05:27,360
you just need to submit a request to the police station.

105
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,639
Your nose is still as sharp as ever.

106
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:31,959
You smelled a chance for a commendation and came running.

107
00:05:42,279 --> 00:05:43,319
I just want a chance.

108
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,079
A chance to become a police officer.

109
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:47,639
I believe

110
00:05:48,279 --> 00:05:49,439
I can definitely be a good police officer.

111
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:51,279
As long as you let me join,

112
00:05:51,279 --> 00:05:52,000
I'll do anything.

113
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:52,959
I don't care how dangerous it is.

114
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,040
Please give me a chance.

115
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,160
Why should I give you a chance?

116
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,040
Because of your eagerness for quick success?

117
00:06:05,319 --> 00:06:07,160
Or because of your opportunism?

118
00:06:12,319 --> 00:06:12,879
Out of the question.

119
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,519
Attention!

120
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,360
Gear up and stand by.

121
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:33,439
Yes, sir!

122
00:06:41,319 --> 00:06:41,920
Good luck.

123
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,000
Good job.

124
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,079
Chief Ji.

125
00:07:26,519 --> 00:07:27,040
Dr. Chen.

126
00:07:28,639 --> 00:07:29,480
Let's begin.

127
00:07:29,879 --> 00:07:30,160
Okay.

128
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,879
Just relax, like you normally do.

129
00:07:35,439 --> 00:07:36,879
Relax your whole body.

130
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,319
And take a deep breath.

131
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:48,639
Chief Ji.

132
00:07:49,399 --> 00:07:50,120
You're here

133
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,199
to replace your ID.

134
00:07:51,959 --> 00:07:52,959
You don't live on Old Street anymore?

135
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,720
Yeah, that place is just too chaotic.

136
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:56,920
I owe you an apology for that.

137
00:07:57,519 --> 00:07:58,560
Please don't say that.

138
00:07:58,879 --> 00:08:00,639
If I hadn't gone out to replace my ID,

139
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:03,079
I probably wouldn't have run into that junkie.

140
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:13,560
Have a seat.

141
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:18,560
Look.

142
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,560
This is what you asked me to look into.

143
00:08:21,759 --> 00:08:22,920
Yuan Lai getting her replacement ID...

144
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:23,560
This is the footage from that day.

145
00:08:24,839 --> 00:08:26,399
I found Gangzi in the footage too.

146
00:08:27,519 --> 00:08:28,199
Rewind a little.

147
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:33,120
He's wanted for a homicide case,

148
00:08:33,879 --> 00:08:34,600
yet he still dared to come here.

149
00:08:40,879 --> 00:08:43,440
I suspect Gangzi came to turn himself in that day.

150
00:08:44,679 --> 00:08:45,919
His sudden change of mind

151
00:08:46,799 --> 00:08:48,360
and Yuan Lai's movements

152
00:08:48,519 --> 00:08:49,639
must be connected.

153
00:08:51,639 --> 00:08:51,960
Here's what you do.

154
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:54,519
For the day Jin Yonggang came to the police station,

155
00:08:54,679 --> 00:08:56,480
from the police station to the pedestrian street,

156
00:08:56,519 --> 00:08:58,360
pull up all the surveillance footage along that route.

157
00:08:58,919 --> 00:08:59,240
Make it fast.

158
00:08:59,559 --> 00:09:00,639
Got it. I'm on it.

159
00:09:10,559 --> 00:09:11,039
In here.

160
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:11,960
Just line them up.

161
00:09:12,399 --> 00:09:13,080
Careful now.

162
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:21,639
Watch out, it's slippery.

163
00:10:35,639 --> 00:10:36,200
Grab your things.

164
00:10:36,799 --> 00:10:37,360
We're leaving now.

165
00:10:45,159 --> 00:10:45,840
Don't worry.

166
00:10:46,519 --> 00:10:47,360
They won't object anymore.

167
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:53,559
We can't leave.

168
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:56,679
My son's passport isn't ready yet.

169
00:10:59,679 --> 00:11:00,600
We're going by boat.

170
00:11:01,559 --> 00:11:02,279
No passport needed.

171
00:11:06,759 --> 00:11:07,480
He's not here.

172
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:09,720
If we leave, it has to be tomorrow.

173
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,639
He's really not here.

174
00:11:18,639 --> 00:11:20,279
He went out with that SWAT officer.

175
00:11:20,279 --> 00:11:21,480
We really can't leave today.

176
00:11:24,519 --> 00:11:25,759
We have to leave today.

177
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:28,000
Make a call and get him back.

178
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:30,200
I can't.

179
00:11:30,759 --> 00:11:32,080
The one who took him out is a cop.

180
00:11:32,399 --> 00:11:34,279
If anything goes wrong, nobody leaves.

181
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:45,679
Don't try to scare me with cops.

182
00:11:46,759 --> 00:11:47,759
If I were afraid,

183
00:11:48,039 --> 00:11:49,080
I wouldn't have come.

184
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:51,799
I'm telling you,

185
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:53,919
if we don't leave today,

186
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:56,639
you and your son will both die.

187
00:11:57,679 --> 00:11:58,360
Make the call.

188
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,399
Tell him to bring the kid back.

189
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,279
Mom!

190
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:54,480
Uncle Liao took me to a castle.

191
00:12:54,679 --> 00:12:56,320
Snow White was there!

192
00:12:57,039 --> 00:12:57,799
Mom...

193
00:12:58,080 --> 00:12:59,159
I think Snow White...

194
00:12:59,159 --> 00:13:01,080
is as kind and pure as you.

195
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,120
Mom?

196
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:06,200
Mom, why aren't you saying anything?

197
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:12,919
It's nothing.

198
00:13:13,879 --> 00:13:15,679
Mom was just organizing the shelves.

199
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:18,679
Are you having fun, Naonao?

200
00:13:19,679 --> 00:13:20,600
Yes!

201
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:23,759
Uncle Liao also said he'll take me to get pizza later.

202
00:13:24,799 --> 00:13:27,159
I bet you begged Uncle Liao to buy it for you, right?

203
00:13:28,559 --> 00:13:30,480
Mom, I didn't ask him.

204
00:13:31,759 --> 00:13:32,360
I looked it up.

205
00:13:33,399 --> 00:13:35,639
There's a family restaurant here ranked number one.

206
00:13:36,279 --> 00:13:37,320
Come join us if you're free.

207
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,200
Naonao.

208
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:52,200
Listen to Uncle Liao.

209
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:55,960
Mom loves you.

210
00:13:58,399 --> 00:13:59,159
I have to go now.

211
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:00,519
A customer just came in.

212
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,000
I'll go with you.

213
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:08,840
What about the kid?

214
00:14:14,679 --> 00:14:16,039
Does the kid matter to you?

215
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:18,120
I'm the one you want.

216
00:14:21,159 --> 00:14:22,120
I don't care.

217
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:23,639
As long as you can bear it.

218
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:28,759
I can't bear it.

219
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:33,720
But compared to that,

220
00:14:38,559 --> 00:14:40,639
I'd rather he live a clean life.

221
00:14:43,679 --> 00:14:44,559
Clean?

222
00:14:44,759 --> 00:14:47,120
Yes, clean.

223
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:56,279
You're meant for big things.

224
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:24,960
Don't worry.

225
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:28,279
As long as you help me make "Spring Snow",

226
00:15:29,519 --> 00:15:31,200
your child will never run out of money.

227
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:52,559
Chief.

228
00:15:53,879 --> 00:15:55,399
Chunxiao Road, Da'an Street,

229
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:56,679
and Roundabout...

230
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:57,440
we've screened them all.

231
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:59,039
It's exactly as you guessed.

232
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:01,679
Jin Yonggang has been following Yuan Lai.

233
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:02,919
So the hostage situation wasn't a coincidence.

234
00:16:07,159 --> 00:16:07,720
What is it, Chief?

235
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:12,559
I saw her at the City Police Bureau today.

236
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:16,320
She told me Jin Yonggang was a junkie.

237
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,200
How did she know he uses drugs?

238
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:21,399
Exactly.

239
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:23,000
How could she know?

240
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:26,120
Our public Wanted Notice

241
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:27,399
didn't disclose that information.

242
00:16:29,279 --> 00:16:30,679
Also, Yuan Lai, just like Jin Yonggang,

243
00:16:31,879 --> 00:16:33,840
appeared at the crime scenes twice.

244
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:35,080
It's too much of a coincidence.

245
00:16:36,759 --> 00:16:37,720
First, at the Mahjong Parlor.

246
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,440
The day Lu Zhong died,

247
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:41,399
she said she was taking her kid to the doctor.

248
00:16:41,679 --> 00:16:42,960
I'm sorry, Comrade.

249
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:45,039
His heart has been weak since birth.

250
00:16:45,039 --> 00:16:46,200
I'm afraid he got scared.

251
00:16:46,639 --> 00:16:47,240
We have a hospital appointment for a checkup.

252
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:49,600
Then we started screening suspects.

253
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:50,360
Leave a number.

254
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,759
She moved out of her old place

255
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:54,799
and came to the police station for a new ID.

256
00:16:55,639 --> 00:16:56,600
You don't live on Old Street anymore?

257
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:59,440
Yeah, that place is just too chaotic.

258
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,480
Right after that, she was taken hostage by Jin Yonggang.

259
00:17:01,919 --> 00:17:02,679
The hostage is in danger!

260
00:17:02,879 --> 00:17:03,759
He was blocked by that guy Tan.

261
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:11,240
That's why Jin Yonggang kept following Yuan Lai.

262
00:17:12,119 --> 00:17:13,039
The hostage situation wasn't a coincidence either.

263
00:17:19,039 --> 00:17:19,839
All right, you go ahead.

264
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:28,359
Lao Na.

265
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,400
Regarding Jin Yonggang's case,

266
00:17:30,839 --> 00:17:32,039
I have an important clue.

267
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:52,839
Mr. Lu,

268
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:55,880
if those two idiots and Pei Laosan

269
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:56,920
take Yuan Lai out to sea,

270
00:17:58,000 --> 00:17:58,960
do we make a move or not?

271
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:08,480
Just take them out.

272
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:09,880
Leave no loose ends.

273
00:18:12,519 --> 00:18:14,599
But there are a lot of Coast Guard patrols here.

274
00:18:15,599 --> 00:18:16,640
If a firefight really breaks out,

275
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:18,119
will we have time to get away?

276
00:18:23,559 --> 00:18:24,920
Wait until they head further out to strike.

277
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:35,440
I'll emphasize this one more time.

278
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:37,759
The orders from above

279
00:18:39,119 --> 00:18:40,160
are to take them alive this time.

280
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:41,880
Unless there are special circumstances,

281
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:43,200
absolutely do not open fire.

282
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:44,519
Understood?

283
00:18:44,799 --> 00:18:45,359
Understood.

284
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:48,640
However,

285
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:49,880
open fire if you have to.

286
00:18:50,119 --> 00:18:50,720
Don't hesitate.

287
00:18:50,839 --> 00:18:51,839
Safety is the top priority.

288
00:18:52,079 --> 00:18:53,720
Captain Liu, you've said this several times.

289
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:54,920
We really get it.

290
00:18:56,759 --> 00:18:56,960
Alright.

291
00:18:57,960 --> 00:18:59,240
Check your gear one last time.

292
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:00,039
Yes, sir.

293
00:19:03,799 --> 00:19:04,240
Bai Jiani,

294
00:19:05,119 --> 00:19:05,799
what's the situation on your end?

295
00:19:06,319 --> 00:19:08,079
Point A is clear. Target hasn't appeared.

296
00:19:09,079 --> 00:19:10,640
Good. Report any developments immediately.

297
00:19:11,279 --> 00:19:11,599
Copy that.

298
00:19:15,640 --> 00:19:15,960
Wind speed.

299
00:19:17,079 --> 00:19:18,519
The drug dealers aren't even here yet. What's the rush?

300
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:19,519
Wind speed.

301
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:27,319
Three knots.

302
00:19:27,559 --> 00:19:28,799
1.441 meters per second.

303
00:19:31,279 --> 00:19:31,680
Are you cold?

304
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:33,519
A little.

305
00:20:00,119 --> 00:20:01,799
I'm Tan Yan from the Special Police Unit.

306
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:04,680
Political Commissar Tan.

307
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:05,359
Here.

308
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:07,359
Pass these around.

309
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:09,200
Thank you, Political Commissar Tan.

310
00:20:11,599 --> 00:20:13,039
Pengpeng, you must be hungry.

311
00:20:14,279 --> 00:20:15,599
Instead of staying at your post,

312
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:16,519
why are you wandering around?

313
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:18,880
I brought you some supplies.

314
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,279
You need to eat and drink well

315
00:20:20,599 --> 00:20:22,319
to stay in fighting shape.

316
00:20:23,279 --> 00:20:23,599
Here.

317
00:20:24,599 --> 00:20:24,799
Have some.

318
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:27,920
Pass these around.

319
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:29,039
Thank you, Political Commissar Tan.

320
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:30,359
Where's Na?

321
00:20:31,519 --> 00:20:32,160
He has something else to do.

322
00:20:33,480 --> 00:20:34,079
What is it?

323
00:20:35,920 --> 00:20:36,599
A new mission.

324
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:40,400
If it's confidential,

325
00:20:41,599 --> 00:20:42,680
I won't ask.

326
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:51,200
Tan.

327
00:20:53,039 --> 00:20:54,640
You're not the Publicity Director anymore.

328
00:20:55,319 --> 00:20:56,480
You're the Political Commissar of the Special Police Unit.

329
00:20:56,559 --> 00:20:58,000
Can't you take your role seriously?

330
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:02,720
I do.

331
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:04,400
Of course I do.

332
00:21:05,799 --> 00:21:07,359
Later, I'll show you all

333
00:21:07,359 --> 00:21:09,920
how our Special Police Unit makes arrests.

334
00:21:20,839 --> 00:21:21,799
Alright, I'm off.

335
00:21:25,400 --> 00:21:26,160
Eat it while it's hot.

336
00:21:27,039 --> 00:21:28,039
When you rush in later,

337
00:21:28,079 --> 00:21:29,039
be careful.

338
00:21:29,279 --> 00:21:29,920
Don't worry.

339
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:31,519
We're all well-trained.

340
00:22:11,119 --> 00:22:11,720
Got a flashlight?

341
00:22:16,599 --> 00:22:17,559
You guys go take a look around back.

342
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:18,160
See if there's a back door.

343
00:22:18,160 --> 00:22:18,319
Go.

344
00:22:41,759 --> 00:22:42,079
Stop.

345
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:46,759
Captain Na, it's Shuahai.

346
00:23:09,000 --> 00:23:10,599
Was the pizza good today?

347
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:12,000
It was great!

348
00:23:17,599 --> 00:23:19,079
Give your mom a call.

349
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:35,400
What are you doing?

350
00:23:38,319 --> 00:23:40,000
Chief Liao, I'm with City Bureau Criminal Investigation.

351
00:23:41,359 --> 00:23:42,160
What are you doing here?

352
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:44,359
Captain Na.

353
00:23:46,519 --> 00:23:47,039
Chief Liao.

354
00:23:48,799 --> 00:23:50,279
Don't you have a mission today?

355
00:23:50,640 --> 00:23:51,400
Why are you here?

356
00:23:52,920 --> 00:23:53,519
We do have an operation.

357
00:23:55,519 --> 00:23:56,720
Do you know the owner of this shop?

358
00:23:57,119 --> 00:23:57,640
I do.

359
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:00,039
What's going on?

360
00:24:03,240 --> 00:24:03,799
Hey kid.

361
00:24:04,759 --> 00:24:05,480
Remember me?

362
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:08,799
Do you know where your mom went?

363
00:24:15,279 --> 00:24:16,079
Do you have his mom's number?

364
00:24:16,599 --> 00:24:18,599
Yes. I just called, but no one answered.

365
00:24:21,559 --> 00:24:22,400
Do you need her for something?

366
00:24:24,759 --> 00:24:25,279
Yeah, just something.

367
00:25:08,480 --> 00:25:09,200
Why did we stop?

368
00:25:10,920 --> 00:25:12,039
Waiting for my brother's call.

369
00:25:14,000 --> 00:25:14,880
What time is the boat?

370
00:25:15,839 --> 00:25:16,720
It's scheduled for 11:00.

371
00:25:17,079 --> 00:25:17,720
What time is it now?

372
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:35,559
Is the boat you arranged reliable?

373
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:39,759
What do you mean?

374
00:25:44,079 --> 00:25:44,960
Before you got here,

375
00:25:45,920 --> 00:25:47,079
the Special Police Unit deployed.

376
00:25:47,599 --> 00:25:49,200
The Special Police Unit deploys all the time.

377
00:25:50,920 --> 00:25:51,440
It's normal.

378
00:25:58,319 --> 00:25:59,799
But something still feels off.

379
00:26:03,079 --> 00:26:04,720
You're just too nervous.

380
00:26:05,599 --> 00:26:07,039
Don't scare yourself.

381
00:26:10,160 --> 00:26:11,160
Just to be safe,

382
00:26:11,359 --> 00:26:12,200
let's leave another day.

383
00:26:13,359 --> 00:26:14,480
We have to leave today.

384
00:26:18,279 --> 00:26:19,160
Don't worry.

385
00:26:20,279 --> 00:26:21,759
My brother is already at the dock.

386
00:26:22,559 --> 00:26:23,680
He'll call me.

387
00:26:48,640 --> 00:26:50,960
Chief Liao, we finished today's City Police Bureau meeting.

388
00:26:51,720 --> 00:26:53,400
This operation is huge.

389
00:26:53,880 --> 00:26:56,440
Criminal Investigation, Narcotics, and SWAT are deploying.

390
00:26:57,039 --> 00:26:57,960
Shouldn't you come back?

391
00:27:19,119 --> 00:27:19,559
Captain Na.

392
00:27:21,960 --> 00:27:22,480
What's the situation?

393
00:27:23,440 --> 00:27:24,680
The door's locked. No sign of anyone.

394
00:27:33,039 --> 00:27:33,640
Where's Pei Laosan?

395
00:27:35,240 --> 00:27:35,839
In the cabin.

396
00:27:44,039 --> 00:27:44,599
You're here.

397
00:27:44,920 --> 00:27:46,559
Chief Liao, you're just in time.

398
00:27:46,880 --> 00:27:48,119
Quickly sync the channels.

399
00:27:48,200 --> 00:27:49,119
I'm handing command over to you.

400
00:27:49,400 --> 00:27:49,920
They're synced.

401
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:53,119
You know the details of this operation better than I do.

402
00:27:53,680 --> 00:27:54,640
You stay in command.

403
00:28:06,279 --> 00:28:07,920
Captain Zhang, target spotted.

404
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:11,799
Why did only one person show up?

405
00:28:23,200 --> 00:28:23,640
Hello?

406
00:28:24,039 --> 00:28:24,680
I'm at the pier.

407
00:28:26,119 --> 00:28:26,440
Okay.

408
00:28:27,240 --> 00:28:28,200
Wait for me on the boat.

409
00:28:28,400 --> 00:28:28,680
Okay.

410
00:28:32,640 --> 00:28:33,079
No problem.

411
00:29:30,599 --> 00:29:31,119
Hello?

412
00:29:31,480 --> 00:29:32,759
Pei Laosan isn't on the boat.

413
00:29:34,440 --> 00:29:34,880
He's not here.

414
00:29:35,400 --> 00:29:36,599
I've searched the whole boat.

415
00:29:36,880 --> 00:29:37,759
His phone is turned off too.

416
00:29:42,960 --> 00:29:43,640
Get out of there.

417
00:29:58,200 --> 00:29:59,119
What happened?

418
00:30:04,119 --> 00:30:05,680
I'm asking you. What happened?

419
00:30:16,920 --> 00:30:17,319
Captain Zhang.

420
00:30:18,720 --> 00:30:19,480
The target is trying to leave.

421
00:30:19,920 --> 00:30:20,240
Do we move in?

422
00:30:21,079 --> 00:30:21,640
We're still missing one.

423
00:30:22,359 --> 00:30:22,759
Move in.

424
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:26,720
Political Commissar Tan, you stay here.

425
00:30:26,759 --> 00:30:27,279
Don't go wandering off.

426
00:30:30,480 --> 00:30:31,240
Stay safe!

427
00:30:33,599 --> 00:30:34,319
Stay safe.

428
00:30:35,839 --> 00:30:36,440
Stay safe.

429
00:30:38,079 --> 00:30:38,880
Stay safe.

430
00:30:42,200 --> 00:30:43,039
Stay safe.

431
00:31:09,599 --> 00:31:10,079
Don't move.

432
00:31:23,799 --> 00:31:24,640
Put your hands up!

433
00:31:26,599 --> 00:31:27,640
Raise your right hand!

434
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:29,680
Put your hands up!

435
00:31:30,039 --> 00:31:30,839
Put your hands up!

436
00:31:30,839 --> 00:31:31,279
Don't move!

437
00:31:31,400 --> 00:31:32,759
Raise your right hand!

438
00:31:32,920 --> 00:31:34,160
Raise your right hand!

439
00:31:34,279 --> 00:31:35,839
Raise your other hand! Now!

440
00:32:00,839 --> 00:32:01,599
I knew

441
00:32:03,359 --> 00:32:05,880
the SWAT deployment had to be related to this.

442
00:32:17,039 --> 00:32:17,519
He's dead.

443
00:32:19,359 --> 00:32:19,960
I can't see clearly.

444
00:32:50,079 --> 00:32:50,759
Get down!

445
00:32:50,920 --> 00:32:51,640
There's another bomb!

446
00:32:52,839 --> 00:32:54,279
Come here! Come here! Come here!

447
00:32:54,680 --> 00:32:55,200
Come here!

448
00:32:56,480 --> 00:32:57,279
What are you doing?

449
00:32:59,079 --> 00:33:00,079
My brother's inside!

450
00:33:00,759 --> 00:33:01,559
I have to save him!

451
00:33:01,559 --> 00:33:02,640
Going there now is suicide!

452
00:33:02,680 --> 00:33:04,079
The pier is swarming with cops.

453
00:33:10,079 --> 00:33:12,000
Everyone, fall back 50 meters! Move!

454
00:33:16,880 --> 00:33:18,759
I've killed one of your men, brother.

455
00:33:20,359 --> 00:33:21,359
In the Mahjong Parlor.

456
00:33:21,519 --> 00:33:22,200
Liao Bufan.

457
00:33:22,559 --> 00:33:23,279
What are you doing?

458
00:33:23,960 --> 00:33:24,559
Fall back!

459
00:33:26,799 --> 00:33:27,839
Liao Bufan!

460
00:33:28,519 --> 00:33:29,200
Fall back!

461
00:33:29,519 --> 00:33:31,079
That's an order! Hurry!

462
00:33:31,799 --> 00:33:32,880
At the time,

463
00:33:33,960 --> 00:33:34,880
he was crouching there.

464
00:33:37,039 --> 00:33:39,559
I aimed at the back of his head.

465
00:33:54,440 --> 00:33:55,039
Chief Liao.

466
00:33:55,839 --> 00:33:56,960
Chief Liao, calm down!

467
00:33:57,799 --> 00:33:59,119
He's deliberately provoking you!

468
00:33:59,279 --> 00:33:59,839
Calm down!

469
00:34:21,320 --> 00:34:22,840
Save the people! Defuse the bomb!

470
00:34:22,880 --> 00:34:23,960
Bomb Disposal Container, quick!

471
00:34:40,679 --> 00:34:41,559
I heard everything he said.

472
00:34:41,760 --> 00:34:42,960
Listen, you need to calm down.

473
00:34:43,239 --> 00:34:44,440
You're the only Bomb Disposal Expert on the team.

474
00:34:44,840 --> 00:34:46,400
Let's go back for our Bomb Disposal Suits, you hear me?

475
00:34:47,079 --> 00:34:47,760
There's no time.

476
00:34:47,960 --> 00:34:48,719
What do you mean?

477
00:34:48,760 --> 00:34:49,719
The bomb's detonator

478
00:34:50,559 --> 00:34:51,440
is wired directly to his heart rate.

479
00:34:55,239 --> 00:34:56,480
Where are you going? Where are you going?

480
00:34:56,760 --> 00:34:57,400
Don't do anything stupid!

481
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:03,800
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

482
00:35:07,840 --> 00:35:09,679
Oxygen cylinder! Hurry!

483
00:35:17,639 --> 00:35:18,719
Are you crazy?

484
00:35:18,800 --> 00:35:19,800
You're the one who's crazy!

485
00:35:20,199 --> 00:35:21,920
Go die if you want to. Don't drag me into this!

486
00:35:28,800 --> 00:35:29,519
Listen to me.

487
00:35:30,159 --> 00:35:31,320
The Special Police Unit has been deployed.

488
00:35:31,800 --> 00:35:33,119
Do you think you can save him?

489
00:35:34,480 --> 00:35:35,400
We're talking business here.

490
00:35:36,599 --> 00:35:38,000
As long as you have me, you'll have "Spring Snow."

491
00:35:38,559 --> 00:35:39,960
Dying or making money, take your pick.

492
00:35:53,559 --> 00:35:53,960
Chief Guo.

493
00:35:54,239 --> 00:35:54,719
Chief Guo.

494
00:35:55,400 --> 00:35:57,440
Why haven't those two evacuated yet?

495
00:35:58,079 --> 00:35:58,760
They're still defusing the bomb.

496
00:35:59,920 --> 00:36:00,360
Where's Tan Yan?

497
00:36:01,039 --> 00:36:01,840
He's on his way there now.

498
00:36:03,239 --> 00:36:03,760
Hold on,

499
00:36:06,400 --> 00:36:07,480
why is he going there to get in the way?

500
00:36:08,880 --> 00:36:11,039
The suspect needs oxygen and his heart rate stabilized

501
00:36:11,559 --> 00:36:13,400
to buy time to defuse the bomb.

502
00:36:36,000 --> 00:36:37,079
Keep going. Don't stop.

503
00:36:39,159 --> 00:36:40,199
I'll keep trying to stop the bleeding.

504
00:36:41,960 --> 00:36:42,960
How's his heart rate?

505
00:36:43,000 --> 00:36:43,880
What's it at?

506
00:36:44,239 --> 00:36:44,719
Forty.

507
00:36:44,719 --> 00:36:45,559
Hurry! Don't stop, don't stop!

508
00:36:50,880 --> 00:36:51,440
Chief Liao!

509
00:36:51,559 --> 00:36:52,360
Hold steady.

510
00:36:54,400 --> 00:36:55,159
Tan Yan, I order you...

511
00:36:55,719 --> 00:36:56,800
...to evacuate with them immediately.

512
00:36:57,679 --> 00:36:58,920
Evacuate with them immediately!

513
00:37:00,400 --> 00:37:00,880
Tan Yan!

514
00:37:01,000 --> 00:37:01,480
Tan Yan!

515
00:37:02,360 --> 00:37:03,000
I order you...

516
00:37:03,480 --> 00:37:04,360
I order you...

517
00:37:04,719 --> 00:37:05,800
...to evacuate with them immediately!

518
00:37:06,280 --> 00:37:07,519
Tan Yan! Tan Yan! I order you...

519
00:37:07,920 --> 00:37:09,079
...to evacuate with them immediately!

520
00:37:09,719 --> 00:37:10,320
Are you sure?

521
00:37:15,519 --> 00:37:16,480
Give me the scissors.

522
00:37:17,480 --> 00:37:19,079
I'll cut it. I'm wearing the Bomb Disposal Suit.

523
00:37:20,159 --> 00:37:20,719
Liao Bufan!

524
00:37:21,079 --> 00:37:21,639
Don't hesitate!

525
00:37:21,639 --> 00:37:23,559
His heart rate is under twenty! Hurry!

526
00:37:25,119 --> 00:37:26,400
Evacuate! Evacuate!

527
00:38:00,639 --> 00:38:01,159
Done.

528
00:38:02,880 --> 00:38:03,320
Done.

529
00:38:10,519 --> 00:38:11,320
Threat neutralized.

530
00:38:12,440 --> 00:38:13,400
The suspect isn't dead.

531
00:38:13,960 --> 00:38:14,639
He's still alive.

532
00:38:15,320 --> 00:38:17,119
Quick, bring the ambulance in!

533
00:38:23,719 --> 00:38:24,920
Chief Guo, these are the bomb fragments we found.

534
00:38:24,920 --> 00:38:25,440
Hurry up, hurry up.

535
00:38:26,559 --> 00:38:27,639
Quickly trace their source.

536
00:38:27,639 --> 00:38:28,079
Yes, sir. Okay.

537
00:38:28,440 --> 00:38:28,719
Here.

538
00:38:28,920 --> 00:38:29,239
Let's go.

539
00:38:31,199 --> 00:38:31,719
Where's Tan Yan?

540
00:38:32,599 --> 00:38:32,880
Tan Yan!

541
00:38:33,320 --> 00:38:34,079
Tan Yan, get over here!

542
00:38:35,960 --> 00:38:36,320
Chief Guo.

543
00:38:39,119 --> 00:38:40,239
As a Political Commissar,

544
00:38:40,760 --> 00:38:41,599
you didn't stop them,

545
00:38:41,960 --> 00:38:43,039
and even joined in with them.

546
00:38:43,599 --> 00:38:44,159
Joined in what?

547
00:38:47,599 --> 00:38:48,079
Chief Guo,

548
00:38:49,199 --> 00:38:50,880
he's the one who murdered Commissar Lu.

549
00:38:52,360 --> 00:38:54,199
Why did you publicly announce the case was closed?

550
00:38:56,239 --> 00:38:57,000
What do you mean?

551
00:38:57,840 --> 00:38:59,760
Handling a case requires proper planning and strategy.

552
00:39:00,039 --> 00:39:01,280
Do I need to explain that to you?

553
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:02,199
Yes.

554
00:39:03,039 --> 00:39:03,679
You do.

555
00:39:04,440 --> 00:39:05,239
I'll explain it to him.

556
00:39:08,559 --> 00:39:09,840
Liao Bufan, listen to me closely.

557
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:12,239
Before a case is cracked,

558
00:39:13,000 --> 00:39:14,280
the first thing is to lock down information.

559
00:39:14,719 --> 00:39:15,760
These are confidentiality regulations.

560
00:39:16,719 --> 00:39:18,360
Haven't you heard of or studied them?

561
00:39:19,320 --> 00:39:19,920
Don't you know them?

562
00:39:20,079 --> 00:39:21,480
Do you really not know, or are you pretending?

563
00:39:23,079 --> 00:39:23,800
That concludes my explanation.

564
00:39:24,480 --> 00:39:25,239
Now you tell me,

565
00:39:26,159 --> 00:39:27,519
why didn't you evacuate just now?

566
00:39:28,800 --> 00:39:29,960
Why didn't you follow orders?

567
00:39:31,360 --> 00:39:32,599
If we had followed orders,

568
00:39:34,679 --> 00:39:35,519
he would be dead.

569
00:39:37,039 --> 00:39:37,800
Once he's dead,

570
00:39:39,119 --> 00:39:40,000
the clues are gone.

571
00:39:41,960 --> 00:39:42,800
Explanation concluded.

572
00:39:49,159 --> 00:39:51,360
If clues are gone, we can find more.

573
00:39:53,360 --> 00:39:54,079
But if lives are lost,

574
00:39:55,239 --> 00:39:57,280
once lives are lost, everything is lost.

575
00:40:03,880 --> 00:40:05,119
You're acting worse than kids.

576
00:40:11,039 --> 00:40:11,480
Commissar Tan,

577
00:40:14,280 --> 00:40:16,519
you knew he killed Commissar Lu all along, didn't you?

578
00:40:24,840 --> 00:40:25,280
I need to take off

579
00:40:25,280 --> 00:40:25,840
the protective suit.

580
00:40:26,440 --> 00:40:27,000
The protective suit.

581
00:40:27,199 --> 00:40:27,800
It's too heavy.

582
00:40:29,599 --> 00:40:31,599
Someone come help me take this off!

583
00:40:32,559 --> 00:40:33,920
Somebody! Help!

584
00:40:34,840 --> 00:40:35,480
Fall in!

585
00:40:59,679 --> 00:41:00,920
Captain Zhang, Captain Na, we found something.

586
00:41:03,519 --> 00:41:04,039
What is it?

587
00:41:04,599 --> 00:41:05,800
This is the jacket Pei Laosan was wearing.

588
00:41:06,920 --> 00:41:08,239
He must've escaped by diving from here.

589
00:41:19,000 --> 00:41:20,519
This kid noticed we're watching him.

590
00:41:23,239 --> 00:41:24,599
I'm telling you, it's not necessarily because of us.

591
00:43:13,000 --> 00:43:14,960
When did you find out about Lu Zhong?

592
00:43:14,960 --> 00:43:16,079
Confidentiality regulations.

593
00:43:16,079 --> 00:43:17,360
I had no choice.

594
00:43:17,360 --> 00:43:19,119
Someone sold your information

595
00:43:19,119 --> 00:43:20,480
to Boss Bai.

596
00:43:20,519 --> 00:43:22,920
Only Lu Haifeng and his people

597
00:43:22,920 --> 00:43:24,320
know my identity.

598
00:43:24,320 --> 00:43:25,880
We can't pin the progress of this case

599
00:43:25,880 --> 00:43:27,639
on him alone.

600
00:43:27,840 --> 00:43:28,920
Try to find Pei Laosan.

601
00:43:29,360 --> 00:43:31,360
Make sure he doesn't fall into police hands.

602
00:43:31,360 --> 00:43:32,719
About this Yuan Lai.

603
00:43:32,719 --> 00:43:33,800
Why did she open that shop

604
00:43:33,800 --> 00:43:35,519
right in front of your Special Police Unit?

605
00:43:35,760 --> 00:43:36,559
Are you interrogating me?
